    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1219">

                <pb facs="1085" n="771" xml:id="pg771"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1255a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-18T13:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 18, 1914, 1 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>39. Informed by Navy Department that launch of <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tennessee</hi> was shot at by Turkish forts at Smyrna, which port was
                    visited at your request. Please advise immediately as to facts and make proper
                    representations to Ottoman Government asking explanation of an act which appears
                    to be unfriendly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
